    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8e/NanashiQBULB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240713022003\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NanashiQBULB\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1039\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NanashiQBULB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"NanashiQBULB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8e/NanashiQBULB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240713022003\" /></a></span> \n</p><p><b>无名战士</b>\n</p><p>一位因过劳而死的公司职员，只野奈奈，发现自己转生到了一个与她最喜欢的动画《女皇之刃传奇》相似的世界！意外地获得了传奇魔物的力量，她成为了美丽战士奈奈，尽管她不在乎战斗，只想近距离观看她最喜欢的战士们的对决。\n\n</p><p>只野奈奈，在一家黑心公司过劳死后，转生为一名美丽战士。\n\n</p><p>她与被封印的传奇魔物梅罗娜订立了契约，并拥有「千变万化」的技能，使她能将自己的右臂变成任何武器或生物。\n\n</p><p>作为动画中出现的美丽战士的超级粉丝，她尽情享受着转生后的生活，因为能近距离接触她们。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"69a4107aa5ffaebad93bb91b8e8f99b6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"NanashiSQBULB-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:72px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:NanashiSQBULB.jpg\" title=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg (398 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:72px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1c/NanashiSQBULB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/72?cb=20240713022255\" title=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg (398 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\